  autocmd TabClosed * call <SID>DeleteClosedTabBuffers()
augroup END

augroup khzhao_nerdtree
  autocmd!
  autocmd VimEnter * call <SID>OpenNERDTree()
  autocmd FileType nerdtree call <SID>NERDTreeKeymaps()
  autocmd User NERDTreeInit call <SID>PrepareNERDTree()
  autocmd BufEnter,WinEnter * call <SID>PrepareNERDTree()
augroup END

